# Example cluster list file.
# Copy this to qa-clusters.txt or prod-clusters.txt and add your cluster URLs.
# One Elasticsearch URL per line. Lines starting with # are ignored.
# Credentials are stored separately in api-keys.json (see auth.py).
#
# Format: https://<host>:<port>
# Example:
# https://o11y-es.us-central1.gcp.qa.cld.elstc.co:9243
